      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ここは僕たちのモンスター娘学園。\n教師陣にまさかのシルバさんが加わった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e587a1b4f3e435e130ccb1540a7bfce6815fcae093fa316a0679353efb94ec19",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "シルバさんの授業を見学することになってしまった。\nこんなに騒がしい教室で大丈夫かな。",
      "jp_sha256": "cbafd783e9fbf732978f8f74dc61cd865c65604cd07d105a36b68919b6dfc41a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "실바 씨의 수업을 참관하게 됐다.\n이렇게 시끄러운 교실에서 괜찮을까.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3cb61d0b023e6aeeff62a4aaf0dd4330a29315ab283fb92e592094b8b8587898:000001_-2119190445336240814:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "シルバさんの授業を見学することになってしまった。\nこんなに騒がしい教室で大丈夫かな。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "500595ba9c4d923077a48fc02af25f672ccd1f4477a9a78e1e09a39e7eac7ae1",
